# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run artifacts pulled down from Drive for the CD-22 investigation.
#
# ~980 MB of evidence, kept locally and deliberately not versioned: git stores
# every revision forever, so one commit of these would bloat the repo
# permanently even after a later deletion. The findings they support live in
# docs/reproducibility_notes.md; the files themselves stay on Drive, which is
# where the campaign's outputs belong.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ply
events.out.tfevents.*
cfg_args*
diagnostics.csv
eval_metrics.json
run_config.json

# The earlier hand-written Colab notebook, kept for reference. 25 MB, almost
# all of it embedded output cells.
typical-expected-execution-on-colab.ipynb

# Executed notebooks downloaded from Colab. The generated sources under
# implementation/notebooks/ are the versioned artifact; these carry outputs.
*-run-result.ipynb
*-run-colab.ipynb
